WEBVTT

01:18.410 --> 01:21.910
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.020 --> 01:24.860
[Episode 25]

01:25.450 --> 01:27.480
Ms. Liao went around you

01:27.610 --> 01:29.150
and went straight to Mr. Kong.

01:29.150 --> 01:30.880
There was nothing you could do.

01:31.350 --> 01:32.450
It is a bit of a pity.

01:36.070 --> 01:37.530
Thank you, Director Fang.

01:38.070 --> 01:39.310
You should go back.

01:39.680 --> 01:41.410
I'll go down and pack my things.

02:04.860 --> 02:08.590
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

02:47.850 --> 02:49.710
[Office Area]

03:42.500 --> 03:46.240
[Office and Personal Documents]

03:46.270 --> 03:47.640
[Cut]

03:47.670 --> 03:48.110
[Office and Personal Documents]

03:50.190 --> 03:51.970
[Removable Drive] [Paste]

03:52.000 --> 03:53.360
[Removable Drive]

03:53.390 --> 03:54.270
[Transferring Files]

03:58.820 --> 04:01.230
[Transferring Files]

04:04.150 --> 04:05.410
[Transferring Files]

04:05.570 --> 04:07.230
It's actually pretty simple.

04:07.750 --> 04:09.040
If there's something you want,

04:09.040 --> 04:10.370
you have to fight for it.

04:10.950 --> 04:13.460
Don't think about
what you've lost right now.

04:12.120 --> 04:13.970
[Compliance Recommendations]

04:13.510 --> 04:16.240
Don't think about the criticism
you're getting.

04:17.310 --> 04:19.240
This is when you have to keep going.

04:19.920 --> 04:20.519
This isn't

04:21.190 --> 04:22.660
about today.

04:22.870 --> 04:24.130
It's about the future.

04:24.430 --> 04:26.650
Every hardship you endure

04:26.800 --> 04:29.060
brings you one step closer to your dream.

04:29.270 --> 04:31.050
If you can't even endure this,

04:31.680 --> 04:34.409
then what you have now
is all you'll ever deserve.

04:34.720 --> 04:35.870
That's the truth.

04:38.510 --> 04:42.500
No matter how defeated, frustrated,
or angry you are,

04:42.950 --> 04:44.150
none of that matters.

04:45.070 --> 04:47.270
What matters is to keep being yourself.

04:47.600 --> 04:49.780
Do it again. And again. And again.

04:49.920 --> 04:51.580
Keep thinking. Keep working.

04:51.760 --> 04:53.510
Keep going.

04:54.190 --> 04:55.720
Always stay focused

04:55.720 --> 04:57.190
on the results you want.

04:58.510 --> 05:01.880
So, as long as you keep running
towards hope,

05:02.600 --> 05:05.800
hope will come sooner than you expect.

05:20.220 --> 05:21.780
[Transferring Files]

05:21.810 --> 05:22.440
[Personal Files] [Shanlifang Materials]

05:26.750 --> 05:31.280
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

06:08.830 --> 06:09.950
Now that we've reached this stage,

06:09.950 --> 06:11.350
the business department

06:11.480 --> 06:12.950
must make good use of

06:12.950 --> 06:14.070
its network resources.

06:14.070 --> 06:16.700
Invite as many representatives
from various industries as possible

06:16.700 --> 06:17.980
to participate in our event.

06:17.980 --> 06:19.160
As for the PR department,

06:19.160 --> 06:21.360
invite as many media outlets as possible,

06:21.360 --> 06:22.630
even influencers.

06:22.750 --> 06:25.190
Let's make this event

06:25.210 --> 06:27.210
as high-profile as possible, okay?

06:28.240 --> 06:29.310
What about the service department?

06:29.310 --> 06:31.730
I'd like to reassign

06:31.800 --> 06:34.220
about 60% of our key staff internally.

06:34.270 --> 06:36.120
Of course, this matter
shouldn't be made public.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.920
The remaining forty percent
will support the event.

06:37.920 --> 06:38.720
Is that okay?

06:40.190 --> 06:41.590
Mr. Li, what do you think?

06:44.360 --> 06:46.750
I think Director Fang's arrangement
is excellent.

06:46.750 --> 06:48.270
We can't spare any more people

06:48.270 --> 06:49.430
to investigate

06:49.800 --> 06:50.659
this right now.

06:51.750 --> 06:53.310
Of course, we'll investigate it.

06:53.310 --> 06:55.370
Let's wait until the banquet is over.

07:06.830 --> 07:08.390
Why are you just coming back?

07:08.390 --> 07:10.120
Were you in meetings all night?

07:10.160 --> 07:12.240
Don't tell me you've
been lying here all night.

07:12.240 --> 07:13.730
No, I just fell asleep.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.800
Didn't you come back a while ago?

07:20.120 --> 07:20.920
What's wrong?

07:21.830 --> 07:23.290
Bad mood? Couldn't sleep?

07:23.870 --> 07:24.560
No.

07:25.510 --> 07:26.510
Still denying it.

07:26.720 --> 07:28.050
Then what are you doing?

07:28.160 --> 07:29.020
Just giving up?

07:29.240 --> 07:30.370
Acting like nothing

07:30.560 --> 07:31.560
matters anymore?

07:32.360 --> 07:34.270
I know you've been treated unfairly.

07:34.270 --> 07:35.720
But if you don't fight for it,

07:35.720 --> 07:37.270
your job won't come back on its own,

07:37.270 --> 07:37.830
right?

07:38.240 --> 07:39.040
No.

07:39.070 --> 07:39.980
You still deny it.

07:39.980 --> 07:41.180
Stop making excuses.

07:41.190 --> 07:42.430
So all that time I spent

07:42.430 --> 07:43.510
training you

07:43.560 --> 07:44.750
was for nothing?

07:46.510 --> 07:47.970
You are back to square one.

07:51.920 --> 07:54.080
You are only temporarily suspended,

07:54.430 --> 07:55.830
not fired.

07:56.600 --> 07:58.750
Look at how you're giving up on yourself.

07:58.750 --> 08:00.190
Can you just listen to me?

08:00.430 --> 08:01.310
Okay, go ahead.

08:01.800 --> 08:03.460
Let's see what you have to say.

08:03.560 --> 08:04.510
Why are you taking it out on me

08:04.510 --> 08:05.830
the second you get back?

08:05.830 --> 08:07.430
I couldn't even get a word in.

08:08.510 --> 08:09.740
Tell me, what else can I do

08:09.740 --> 08:10.740
about Liao Shiyu?

08:11.090 --> 08:12.440
I've done everything

08:12.460 --> 08:13.890
I possibly could.

08:13.920 --> 08:15.450
But she just looks down on me

08:15.480 --> 08:16.310
and targets me.

08:16.310 --> 08:17.510
What can I do about it?

08:17.680 --> 08:18.450
So?

08:19.200 --> 08:20.630
So you're just going to let her
push you around?

08:20.630 --> 08:21.630
No.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.630
Why don't you just get it?

08:23.630 --> 08:24.630
See for yourself.

08:30.300 --> 08:31.260
[Venue: Shanlifang Hotel Ballroom]

08:31.330 --> 08:32.520
[Main Stage]
[Head Table] [Catering Area]

08:35.340 --> 08:36.600
When did you start doing this?

08:36.600 --> 08:37.549
Last night.

08:37.630 --> 08:39.230
I was planning it last night,

08:39.320 --> 08:41.070
but it wasn't fully thought out yet.

08:41.070 --> 08:42.470
But I've got you, don't I?

08:46.310 --> 08:47.770
[Shanlifang Hotel Group
Charity Banquet Project Proposal]

08:47.790 --> 08:48.150
[Contents] [Event Objectives]
[Event Information]

08:50.790 --> 08:53.180
You also thought of the charity banquet?

08:53.600 --> 08:54.860
Who else thought of it?

08:54.910 --> 08:56.030
Fang Yun.

08:57.440 --> 08:58.360
You two....

08:58.380 --> 09:00.240
Great minds think alike, really.

09:00.320 --> 09:02.100
She wanted to hold
a charity banquet that day

09:02.100 --> 09:03.550
and do the donation thing.

09:03.550 --> 09:04.770
Donation?

09:05.320 --> 09:08.250
Trying to cover up negative news
with positive news?

09:08.840 --> 09:10.710
It can distract people,

09:10.750 --> 09:13.350
but it won't work as well
as a straight apology.

09:13.390 --> 09:14.900
An apology?

09:15.360 --> 09:17.840
You saw Liao Shiyu's attitude.

09:18.200 --> 09:20.000
She'd never agree to that.

09:20.490 --> 09:21.720
So,

09:21.750 --> 09:24.290
if only half of the executives
in this world

09:24.480 --> 09:26.000
could swallow their pride,

09:26.000 --> 09:27.200
there wouldn't be

09:27.200 --> 09:28.220
so many scandals.

09:35.200 --> 09:37.860
I thought this whole thing
had knocked you down.

09:38.150 --> 09:39.410
I worried for nothing.

09:41.240 --> 09:43.200
What's there for you to worry about?

09:43.200 --> 09:44.240
I was worried you'd panic

09:44.240 --> 09:45.440
and smash this place.

09:46.960 --> 09:49.780
But yeah, I really was crushed.

09:49.960 --> 09:52.050
But I saw the video

09:52.080 --> 09:53.480
you edited for Fulaxida.

09:54.320 --> 09:55.450
I'm warning you.

09:55.480 --> 09:57.200
You have to pay to use my image.

09:57.910 --> 09:59.080
I asked you to delete those photos,

09:59.080 --> 09:59.670
but you didn't delete them,

09:59.670 --> 10:01.600
and you even made them into a video?

10:01.720 --> 10:02.320
What?

10:02.320 --> 10:03.510
You watched the annual gala video

10:03.510 --> 10:04.640
I made for Fulaxida?

10:05.960 --> 10:07.630
Who told you to watch it?

10:08.910 --> 10:09.960
I haven't even added
the post-production stuff

10:09.960 --> 10:11.270
like filters, beauty effects,

10:11.270 --> 10:12.550
and skin smoothing.

10:12.550 --> 10:13.030
Why...

10:13.440 --> 10:14.160
Alright.

10:14.180 --> 10:14.840
Don't you know

10:14.840 --> 10:15.600
what you look like?

10:15.600 --> 10:17.790
You'd look the same
even with skin smoothing.

10:17.790 --> 10:18.910
It's not much to look at,

10:18.910 --> 10:20.110
but you did a good job.

10:20.910 --> 10:21.790
That's right.

10:22.910 --> 10:23.630
Look,

10:24.600 --> 10:26.710
Fulaxida also had rough patches,

10:26.750 --> 10:27.340
right?

10:27.440 --> 10:29.240
Didn't it still make it through?

10:29.270 --> 10:30.320
So I believe

10:30.600 --> 10:32.860
certain people can also make it through.

10:35.210 --> 10:36.050
I remember

10:36.120 --> 10:38.520
you said something
at the end of that video.

10:38.630 --> 10:40.840
You said as long as
you keep running towards hope,

10:40.840 --> 10:42.970
hope will come sooner than you expect.

10:43.720 --> 10:45.960
So, let's keep running.

10:46.670 --> 10:48.440
Even though Liao Shiyu

10:48.720 --> 10:50.360
kicked me out of the sponsor team,

10:50.360 --> 10:51.670
I believe Shanlifang

10:51.870 --> 10:53.670
will definitely invite me back.

11:06.480 --> 11:09.810
As long as you keep running toward hope,

11:10.870 --> 11:11.430
then...

11:11.530 --> 11:12.750
What was the next sentence?

11:12.750 --> 11:15.570
Hope will come sooner than you expect.

11:15.630 --> 11:16.800
Not bad.

11:17.760 --> 11:18.790
Now you've got the idea.

11:18.790 --> 11:20.520
I didn't teach you for nothing.

11:22.660 --> 11:24.940
You show great promise.

11:26.240 --> 11:27.510
I knew it.

11:29.630 --> 11:30.970
You're good now.

11:32.380 --> 11:34.840
You can even guess
what I'm going to say next.

11:39.630 --> 11:42.510
Dad, I'm sure handling it this way

11:42.870 --> 11:44.530
will resolve the crisis soon.

11:45.670 --> 11:47.070
Of course, I believe you.

11:47.600 --> 11:49.670
Go get some sleep after breakfast.

11:50.240 --> 11:51.200
You stayed up all night yesterday.

11:51.200 --> 11:52.000
That won't do.

11:52.030 --> 11:54.030
It breaks my heart to see you like this.

11:54.030 --> 11:55.840
Don't worry, I'm fine.

11:59.670 --> 12:02.630
I heard Wang's parents came to Shanghai.

12:04.320 --> 12:04.900
Yes.

12:06.360 --> 12:08.690
His mother is sick and hospitalized here.

12:11.030 --> 12:12.230
Have you visited her?

12:15.440 --> 12:18.630
But his mother doesn't
seem to like me very much.

12:24.910 --> 12:25.600
Shiyu,

12:26.480 --> 12:28.480
don't care too much
about those small things.

12:28.480 --> 12:31.870
You're going
to manage Shanlifang in the future.

12:32.830 --> 12:33.660
I understand.

12:34.480 --> 12:35.070
Dad.

12:36.320 --> 12:38.670
Don't be afraid if there are
problems with the group.

12:38.670 --> 12:39.750
I will help you.

12:40.960 --> 12:43.000
I will try to make you worry less.

12:49.270 --> 12:50.720
Based on Director Fang's
suggestions yesterday,

12:50.720 --> 12:53.030
this banquet proposal
outlines the venue layout,

12:53.030 --> 12:53.840
the banquet schedule,

12:53.840 --> 12:55.390
and a preferred list of guests.

12:55.390 --> 12:58.590
Of course, for your reference only,
Vice President Liao.

13:00.240 --> 13:02.440
Does anyone else have any suggestions?

13:03.090 --> 13:05.720
Why does this proposal feel so familiar?

13:10.960 --> 13:11.890
What did you say?

13:14.240 --> 13:14.910
Nothing.

13:15.000 --> 13:17.120
I mean, this proposal
is excellent

13:17.150 --> 13:17.910
and comprehensive.

13:17.910 --> 13:19.670
If you don't have any useful suggestions,

13:19.670 --> 13:20.720
don't speak.

13:23.630 --> 13:25.150
Mr. Fang, you really
have this under control.

13:25.150 --> 13:26.440
And Mr. Li, you truly live up
to his name.

13:26.440 --> 13:29.120
Our joint sponsor team is outstanding.

13:29.240 --> 13:31.550
Send this proposal to all departments,

13:31.670 --> 13:33.530
and let's start implementing it.

13:36.990 --> 13:44.010
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

13:48.440 --> 13:49.270
Director Fang,

13:49.270 --> 13:51.530
what do you think of today's PR proposal?

13:52.670 --> 13:53.930
You guys go down first.

13:56.360 --> 13:58.620
Zhizhong Investment is no small player.

13:58.960 --> 14:00.150
Being so busy with work,

14:00.150 --> 14:02.440
you can still spare
the energy and brainpower

14:02.440 --> 14:05.130
to make a plan like this for Shanlifang.

14:07.890 --> 14:08.530
Not bad.

14:08.560 --> 14:09.800
But then again,

14:09.870 --> 14:11.030
this proposal might actually

14:11.030 --> 14:13.030
turn things around for Shanlifang.

14:13.410 --> 14:15.820
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

14:14.080 --> 14:15.920
This wasn't done by our team.

14:16.870 --> 14:18.360
Director Fang, I'm sure

14:18.390 --> 14:19.840
you know who did it.

14:22.110 --> 14:22.940
Qian Fei.

14:27.570 --> 14:29.750
Did she also think
of the charity banquet,

14:29.750 --> 14:30.810
or did you tell her?

14:30.840 --> 14:31.550
No.

14:32.360 --> 14:35.000
Great minds really do think alike.

14:36.870 --> 14:37.640
Is that so?

14:39.120 --> 14:40.080
But then again,

14:40.080 --> 14:41.600
this proposal is truly impressive.

14:41.600 --> 14:43.340
From design to organization,

14:43.390 --> 14:45.880
even the guest list is so detailed.

14:46.240 --> 14:47.530
Putting together something

14:47.530 --> 14:48.800
this detailed in such a short time...

14:48.800 --> 14:50.020
Did she do it alone?

14:51.510 --> 14:53.950
You really did
have a sharp eye, Director Fang.

14:53.950 --> 14:55.950
A person's potential is limitless.

14:56.150 --> 14:58.270
I'm sure you know

14:58.890 --> 15:00.550
why she asked me to release it.

15:01.030 --> 15:01.780
Liao Shiyu.

15:03.570 --> 15:04.140
Yes.

15:04.480 --> 15:06.730
So, thank you, Mr. Li.

15:07.250 --> 15:08.730
It's all part of the job.

15:09.750 --> 15:11.480
Actually, what I'm trying to say is...

15:11.480 --> 15:13.940
What I admire
isn't just Qian Fei's ability.

15:15.840 --> 15:17.770
Even if she hadn't been suspended,

15:18.160 --> 15:20.320
none of this was even her job.

15:23.210 --> 15:26.170
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

15:24.120 --> 15:26.080
She was treated so unfairly,

15:26.340 --> 15:27.870
and she still gave it everything she had

15:27.870 --> 15:30.580
to help Shanlifang
without expecting anything in return.

15:30.580 --> 15:31.870
I actually admire her.

15:34.090 --> 15:35.190
No one forced her.

15:35.750 --> 15:36.840
She chose to do it.

15:41.470 --> 15:42.440
Let's go down.

15:42.550 --> 15:43.080
Okay.

15:54.240 --> 15:55.030
You're back.

15:57.550 --> 15:58.350
I'm starving.

16:05.270 --> 16:07.180
What are you up to now?

16:09.000 --> 16:10.230
Becoming a nun?

16:12.150 --> 16:12.960
Alright.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.440
Stop sitting there.
Cook some food already.

16:15.440 --> 16:16.340
I'm starving.

16:17.000 --> 16:17.960
I'm meditating.

16:18.550 --> 16:19.280
Meditate...

16:20.670 --> 16:21.550
You...

16:22.270 --> 16:24.610
You can't think of anything
on an empty stomach,

16:24.610 --> 16:25.180
right?

16:25.390 --> 16:26.550
Cook some food.

16:27.480 --> 16:29.550
Go wash the vegetables you want to eat.

16:29.550 --> 16:30.680
Then put them there.

16:31.270 --> 16:32.760
I'll only cook today.

16:32.960 --> 16:34.120
No prep work.

16:35.240 --> 16:37.200
I-I don't know how to do that.

16:37.240 --> 16:38.470
Then don't eat.

16:44.670 --> 16:45.270
All right.

16:46.360 --> 16:47.120
Wait.

16:52.160 --> 16:53.200
I'll wash it.

17:09.160 --> 17:09.980
[Price List for Chores]

17:12.829 --> 17:15.310
Man, it's flooded.

17:15.589 --> 17:16.510
You've been washing those forever,

17:16.510 --> 17:18.240
yet you just washed
a few vegetable leaves?

17:18.240 --> 17:19.700
And you're wasting water.

17:22.200 --> 17:22.960
That's not right.

17:22.960 --> 17:23.790
What's wrong

17:24.200 --> 17:25.920
with you today?

17:27.880 --> 17:29.270
You've been nitpicking all day.

17:29.270 --> 17:30.930
You are not usually like this.

17:31.790 --> 17:32.720
What do you mean? Just say it.

17:32.720 --> 17:34.200
Tell me directly
if you have a problem with me.

17:34.200 --> 17:35.200
Tell me directly.

17:35.590 --> 17:37.240
I talked to Zhao De on the phone.

17:37.240 --> 17:38.960
Why is the PR proposal
you provided to Shanlifang

17:38.960 --> 17:40.690
different from the one we made?

17:41.790 --> 17:42.720
Is it different?

17:43.630 --> 17:45.590
Do I need to compare them side by side?

17:45.590 --> 17:46.710
I remember now.

17:47.030 --> 17:47.650
Yes.

17:47.680 --> 17:49.350
I made some modifications in a few places.

17:49.350 --> 17:50.640
I polished it a bit.

17:50.740 --> 17:51.740
Polished?

17:51.830 --> 17:54.230
You deleted my most important part.

17:54.350 --> 17:55.270
Do you know

17:55.270 --> 17:56.440
the most important purpose
of hosting this banquet

17:56.440 --> 17:58.650
is to publicly apologize,

17:58.680 --> 18:00.270
not to protect Shanlifang's image?

18:00.270 --> 18:01.440
You know it, right?

18:01.590 --> 18:03.970
Yes, you're right. I deleted it.

18:04.110 --> 18:04.910
What's wrong?

18:05.880 --> 18:06.920
Let me tell you.

18:07.030 --> 18:08.110
Because if I didn't do this,

18:08.110 --> 18:09.440
Liao Shiyu wouldn't agree

18:09.440 --> 18:10.970
to host that banquet at all.

18:11.720 --> 18:14.120
Then what's the point
of planning all this?

18:14.960 --> 18:16.920
Why should the client go along

18:17.150 --> 18:19.080
with everything in your proposal?

18:19.680 --> 18:21.000
Are you confident Liao Shiyu

18:21.000 --> 18:23.070
will follow your proposal to the letter?

18:23.070 --> 18:24.440
You can't, right?

18:25.710 --> 18:27.260
We're investment bankers.

18:28.110 --> 18:30.550
Our job is simply to help companies

18:30.590 --> 18:31.590
go public.

18:32.160 --> 18:34.490
The fact that you wanted
to help is enough.

18:35.270 --> 18:37.070
Right? I said it last night, too.

18:37.350 --> 18:39.070
I will find a chance to get your job back.

18:39.070 --> 18:40.280
I keep my word.

18:40.590 --> 18:41.790
If all I wanted was my job back,

18:41.790 --> 18:43.390
I wouldn't have left that meeting room

18:43.390 --> 18:44.760
without a word

18:44.790 --> 18:46.160
or any explanation.

18:46.350 --> 18:47.640
I really thought too highly of you.

18:47.640 --> 18:49.970
I shouldn't have discussed this with you.

18:51.680 --> 18:53.610
I helped you, and now it's my fault?

18:53.920 --> 18:55.450
You think you're helping me

18:55.590 --> 18:56.880
by your own standards
of right and wrong.

18:56.880 --> 18:58.690
But that kind of "help"

18:58.750 --> 18:59.750
isn't helping me.

18:59.830 --> 19:01.440
You're so full of yourself.

19:01.640 --> 19:02.510
What? I...

19:04.510 --> 19:06.440
How am I so full of myself?

19:17.070 --> 19:19.000
Li Yifei, you're so bad with words.

19:39.830 --> 19:41.760
Well, where are you going?

19:50.400 --> 19:51.530
Where are you going?

19:53.520 --> 19:55.780
I already washed the vegetables for you.

19:58.750 --> 19:59.440
Oh no.

20:00.920 --> 20:01.640
Oh no.

20:02.230 --> 20:03.760
Now there's nothing to eat.

20:05.430 --> 20:06.430
What's the use?

20:07.160 --> 20:08.620
I washed them for nothing.

20:10.060 --> 20:10.720
That's it.

20:18.920 --> 20:20.450
The food here is quite good.

20:23.360 --> 20:24.420
Wait a minute.

20:24.640 --> 20:25.920
You've been suspended.

20:25.920 --> 20:27.780
Why don't you seem worried at all?

20:28.240 --> 20:29.270
Something is wrong.

20:29.270 --> 20:30.750
How could I not be worried?

20:31.640 --> 20:33.240
Work is important,

20:33.750 --> 20:36.480
but going home
for the New Year is also important.

20:36.820 --> 20:40.150
[Sold out]

20:40.310 --> 20:42.920
How did the tickets sell out so fast?

20:43.790 --> 20:44.720
Look at you.

20:44.790 --> 20:47.090
The Spring Festival
is around the corner.

20:47.090 --> 20:48.970
It's the world's largest

20:49.000 --> 20:50.270
mammal migration.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.790
You're such a planner.

20:53.030 --> 20:55.360
How could you not book
a ticket in advance?

20:56.790 --> 20:59.280
I've just been swamped with work lately.

20:59.310 --> 21:01.110
So I completely forgot about it.

21:02.050 --> 21:03.560
[Sold out]

21:04.440 --> 21:05.640
Look, I can only try my luck
with the ticket queue.

21:05.640 --> 21:06.950
Look, from here to here.

21:06.950 --> 21:08.210
Let me check it for you.

21:12.680 --> 21:14.320
The success rate

21:14.350 --> 21:15.880
is only over 20% these days.

21:16.020 --> 21:17.830
What about booking one a few days earlier?

21:17.830 --> 21:19.120
A few days earlier...

21:20.920 --> 21:22.580
There are tickets on this day.

21:24.040 --> 21:25.590
[Shanghai to Xi'an]

21:28.200 --> 21:29.450
If I go back too early,

21:29.480 --> 21:31.100
my dad will overthink.

21:31.160 --> 21:32.920
If he finds out I have problems at work,

21:32.920 --> 21:33.530
he will be worried.

21:33.530 --> 21:34.130
No.

21:34.160 --> 21:34.750
True.

21:35.350 --> 21:36.590
How could someone as dedicated as you

21:36.590 --> 21:38.790
take so many days off in advance?

21:42.620 --> 21:44.220
Have you booked your ticket?

21:45.590 --> 21:47.410
Just mentioning it annoys me.

21:48.440 --> 21:49.680
My family is insisting

21:49.680 --> 21:51.000
that I bring a boyfriend home this year.

21:51.000 --> 21:53.000
I don't know what they're thinking.

21:55.350 --> 21:57.240
Since when did you become so obedient,

21:57.240 --> 21:58.210
just like Jun?

22:00.160 --> 22:02.550
Actually, it doesn't matter
if I bring one or not.

22:02.550 --> 22:05.060
But I only go back once a year.

22:05.480 --> 22:07.000
I just don't want to make them unhappy

22:07.000 --> 22:08.330
over such a small thing.

22:11.870 --> 22:13.400
What about taking Jun back?

22:13.440 --> 22:15.120
He cares about you a lot.

22:16.310 --> 22:17.320
So what?

22:17.440 --> 22:18.750
His mom dotes on him.

22:18.880 --> 22:22.210
There's no way she'd let him
spend New Year's away from home.

22:22.440 --> 22:23.400
What about you?

22:24.920 --> 22:26.320
Do you want me to help you?

22:26.450 --> 22:28.050
Hurry up and get your ticket.

22:30.160 --> 22:33.220
I'll find a few groups
and share the ticket link for you.

22:38.550 --> 22:41.680
These stir-fried eggplant strips
don't taste good anymore.

22:41.680 --> 22:42.510
It doesn't taste nearly

22:42.510 --> 22:43.970
as good as the landlady's.

22:45.000 --> 22:45.680
Is that so?

22:46.400 --> 22:48.200
Then why did you piss her off?

22:48.480 --> 22:50.140
Aren't you just asking for it?

22:52.110 --> 22:53.160
Mocking me, huh?

22:53.350 --> 22:54.810
Did you do that on purpose?

22:55.750 --> 22:56.350
Fine.

22:57.720 --> 22:58.520
Just you wait.

22:58.880 --> 22:59.880
Where's my phone?

23:01.070 --> 23:03.600
I'm changing the password
to my game account.

23:04.310 --> 23:05.030
Bro.

23:06.110 --> 23:06.880
I was wrong.

23:07.550 --> 23:08.280
You admit it?

23:09.240 --> 23:10.510
Look at you.

23:11.000 --> 23:12.480
You haven't even
sorted out your own stuff,

23:12.480 --> 23:13.740
and you're mocking me.

23:14.680 --> 23:17.140
I've really got
to say something about that.

23:17.270 --> 23:19.400
Even if I can't win over the girl I like,

23:19.440 --> 23:20.890
at least I'll try.

23:21.110 --> 23:22.960
I borrowed your account
to play games with her.

23:22.960 --> 23:24.820
It's quietly looking out for her.

23:25.550 --> 23:26.650
Now look at you.

23:26.750 --> 23:28.480
You are with Qian Fei every day.

23:28.480 --> 23:29.440
Not only do you
lack the courage to confess,

23:29.440 --> 23:31.200
but you also constantly make her unhappy

23:31.200 --> 23:32.330
and disrespect her.

23:33.200 --> 23:34.620
How am I disrespecting her?

23:34.620 --> 23:36.470
I respect her too much.

23:37.830 --> 23:40.080
Qian Fei has more
important things to do now.

23:40.080 --> 23:41.380
Her job is unstable,

23:41.550 --> 23:43.070
and her family is pressuring her.

23:43.070 --> 23:45.310
I can't take advantage of her situation.

23:45.310 --> 23:47.000
Once everything's going her way,

23:47.000 --> 23:47.830
she's in a good mood,

23:47.830 --> 23:49.160
and she's ready to date,

23:49.720 --> 23:51.390
I'll win her over in one go.

23:51.960 --> 23:52.850
You know what?

23:52.880 --> 23:54.830
This is confidence.

23:55.440 --> 23:56.160
Got it?

23:56.680 --> 23:57.900
Listen to me.

23:57.960 --> 23:58.830
Learn from me.

23:58.830 --> 24:00.200
Have a good talk with Qian Fei,

24:00.200 --> 24:01.640
and open up to each other.

24:02.120 --> 24:04.180
You only opened up

24:04.240 --> 24:05.550
because of your mom.

24:05.780 --> 24:07.760
How is my situation the same

24:08.160 --> 24:09.070
as yours?

24:11.030 --> 24:11.700
Fine.

24:11.860 --> 24:14.520
Let's see how long you can
keep acting like this.

24:21.550 --> 24:22.350
It tastes bad.

24:39.830 --> 24:42.160
Don't you have hands or legs?

24:42.640 --> 24:43.920
Can't you take out the trash?

24:43.920 --> 24:46.120
You've got me playing housekeeper now.

24:46.920 --> 24:48.260
No, I...

24:48.440 --> 24:50.880
I wanted to take it out,
but I fell asleep.

24:56.750 --> 24:58.960
Have you eaten?

25:01.400 --> 25:02.660
If you haven't,

25:02.720 --> 25:04.550
go make something for yourself.

25:06.110 --> 25:07.440
Don't starve yourself.

25:09.720 --> 25:11.240
Where have you been?

25:11.270 --> 25:13.200
You didn't even reply to my WeChat.

25:16.000 --> 25:16.720
What's the matter?

25:16.720 --> 25:19.320
Why are you ignoring me
when I'm talking to you?

25:51.680 --> 25:53.540
Drinking coffee so late at night?

25:55.440 --> 25:57.970
Aren't you worried
you won't be able to sleep?

25:59.960 --> 26:00.640
Never mind.

26:00.970 --> 26:01.820
Alright.

26:02.240 --> 26:03.680
Fine, I'll do you a favor

26:04.800 --> 26:05.930
and drink it.

26:15.250 --> 26:17.250
I carry them with me all the time now.

26:21.120 --> 26:23.930
[Price List for Chores]

26:21.310 --> 26:23.040
You really live up to your name—

26:23.720 --> 26:25.400
no money, no smile, huh?

26:27.430 --> 26:29.030
You're not still mad, right?

26:29.030 --> 26:30.220
I'm suspended right now.

26:30.220 --> 26:32.220
So you are my only source of income.

26:33.200 --> 26:34.750
If I stay mad,

26:34.830 --> 26:36.260
how can I earn your money?

26:36.550 --> 26:39.150
Alright. The landlady is generous.

26:39.400 --> 26:40.220
I like that.

26:40.640 --> 26:43.480
Then let's consider this settled.

26:49.830 --> 26:50.640
Fei,

26:51.270 --> 26:53.100
when are you coming home for the New Year?

26:53.100 --> 26:54.690
Bring your boyfriend back

26:54.720 --> 26:55.780
and let me meet him.

26:57.920 --> 26:59.590
T-That's not convenient.

26:59.680 --> 27:01.230
He has to be with his dad.

27:01.480 --> 27:02.870
Didn't you say

27:03.240 --> 27:05.070
that he was at odds with his dad?

27:05.290 --> 27:07.290
Just bring him to our house.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.790
I've got plenty of fatherly love to spare.

27:08.790 --> 27:09.920
You can't use it all.

27:10.030 --> 27:11.360
Let's save some for him.

27:12.550 --> 27:13.030
Dad,

27:13.030 --> 27:16.030
you're getting pretty good
at smooth-talking people.

27:16.030 --> 27:17.640
He made up with his dad a long time ago.

27:17.640 --> 27:19.440
He has to go home for the New Year.

27:19.880 --> 27:21.600
He definitely can't make it this year.

27:21.600 --> 27:22.930
How about next year?

27:23.030 --> 27:24.480
I'll find a way to get him to visit you.

27:24.480 --> 27:25.300
Is that okay?

27:25.680 --> 27:26.160
Okay.

27:27.400 --> 27:29.070
If he really can't come,

27:29.440 --> 27:31.110
let me say a few words to him.

27:32.830 --> 27:34.370
H-How can he do that?

27:35.480 --> 27:36.480
Well,

27:36.480 --> 27:38.210
he's not with me right now.

27:38.230 --> 27:39.040
He went out.

27:39.070 --> 27:39.920
Why not?

27:41.810 --> 27:44.510
Hello, Uncle. Uncle Su.

27:44.920 --> 27:46.790
Uncle Su, it's me.

27:47.030 --> 27:48.150
Li, right?

27:48.270 --> 27:49.480
Yes, it's me.

27:49.500 --> 27:50.830
I just happen to be here.

27:51.400 --> 27:52.820
Fei told me

27:53.030 --> 27:54.430
that your last name is Su.

27:55.750 --> 27:56.880
Everything is fine.

27:58.720 --> 28:00.000
Bad timing.

28:00.200 --> 28:04.020
I really do have to go home and
spend New Year's with my dad this year.

28:06.000 --> 28:07.640
Well, I promise you this.

28:08.350 --> 28:11.720
Next year, I will definitely
spend the New Year with you.

28:14.740 --> 28:16.390
Okay, don't worry.

28:17.070 --> 28:20.280
I will definitely take good care of Fei.

28:22.000 --> 28:22.720
By the way,

28:23.680 --> 28:25.540
you have to promise me one thing.

28:28.310 --> 28:30.560
Take good care of your health.

28:32.890 --> 28:33.500
And

28:36.070 --> 28:37.670
say hello to Auntie He for me.

28:38.440 --> 28:39.030
Okay.

28:39.750 --> 28:40.830
Okay. Okay.

28:42.350 --> 28:44.660
T-Then I'll give the phone to Fei.

28:45.000 --> 28:45.950
No need?

28:46.070 --> 28:48.370
Okay.

28:48.590 --> 28:49.770
Okay, you too.

28:56.160 --> 28:57.220
Are you spaced out?

29:00.440 --> 29:01.360
You don't know

29:01.610 --> 29:03.400
how scared I was just now.

29:03.960 --> 29:05.200
I was afraid you'd lose your head

29:05.200 --> 29:07.010
and talk nonsense to my dad.

29:07.240 --> 29:08.350
That was a close one.

29:08.350 --> 29:09.640
It really scared me to death.

29:09.640 --> 29:10.920
Moral of the story:

29:10.960 --> 29:13.220
Have your story straight before you lie.

29:14.350 --> 29:16.640
To get a moment of peace,

29:16.670 --> 29:18.930
I lied to my dad
about having a boyfriend.

29:19.510 --> 29:21.040
Now, to cover up this lie,

29:21.220 --> 29:23.390
I'm practically writing
a whole TV series now.

29:23.390 --> 29:24.230
It's fine.

29:24.640 --> 29:26.640
I can keep acting as your boyfriend.

29:28.030 --> 29:29.260
And don't worry.

29:29.830 --> 29:31.040
After your dad heard

29:31.070 --> 29:33.740
my calm, dependable voice,

29:33.790 --> 29:37.170
he totally trusts and likes me.

29:37.730 --> 29:38.360
Alright.

29:38.590 --> 29:40.190
Your acting was pretty good.

29:40.200 --> 29:41.800
You're not bad as a stand-in.

29:43.550 --> 29:45.880
That's half my New Year's problem solved.

29:46.790 --> 29:49.390
I'll just wait and see
what you do next New Year.

29:49.480 --> 29:50.030
What?

29:50.030 --> 29:51.960
You think I can't find
a boyfriend in a year?

29:51.960 --> 29:53.640
Looks like next year I'm going to

29:53.640 --> 29:55.960
be your rental boyfriend for the New Year.

29:55.960 --> 29:57.440
Next year, you might end up being

29:57.440 --> 29:59.160
someone's live-in son-in-law.

29:59.160 --> 30:00.060
Why?

30:00.590 --> 30:02.160
Why am I the live-in son-in-law?

30:02.160 --> 30:03.420
You are so poor.

30:03.510 --> 30:04.550
If you don't become a live-in son-in-law,

30:04.550 --> 30:06.480
which girl would dare to marry you?

30:07.400 --> 30:09.000
Didn't you take me in?

30:11.550 --> 30:12.750
Don't stay at my door.

30:12.750 --> 30:14.210
I'm going to take a shower.

30:23.560 --> 30:25.910
[Senior Executive]
[Senior Software Engineer]

30:24.880 --> 30:25.550
Lu Ze.

30:25.930 --> 30:27.270
[Education Background:
Master of Science in Computer Science]

30:26.310 --> 30:29.960
Both your education
and experience are excellent.

30:30.920 --> 30:32.040
But

30:32.640 --> 30:34.160
your last startup failed.

30:35.160 --> 30:35.920
Yes.

30:39.510 --> 30:41.770
Okay, please introduce yourself first.

30:41.790 --> 30:43.330
As written in my resume,

30:43.750 --> 30:45.480
I have 6 years of R&D experience

30:45.510 --> 30:47.570
and founded a 40-person R&D company.

30:47.720 --> 30:48.720
During this entrepreneurial experience,

30:48.720 --> 30:51.430
because we never finished
developing the product,

30:51.430 --> 30:53.580
the investors withdrew their funding.

30:53.580 --> 30:54.900
After thinking twice,

30:55.000 --> 30:56.250
to reduce losses,

30:56.710 --> 30:58.060
I shut down the company.

30:59.550 --> 31:00.680
My personal values are

31:00.680 --> 31:02.480
humility, integrity, responsibility,

31:02.480 --> 31:04.310
innovation, and contributing to society.

31:04.310 --> 31:05.030
So if you

31:05.030 --> 31:06.890
are willing to give me a chance...

31:07.730 --> 31:09.390
What is your expected salary?

31:11.830 --> 31:13.200
I'm expecting

31:14.480 --> 31:15.210
over 20,000.

31:20.000 --> 31:22.490
Mr. Lu, with all due respect,

31:22.790 --> 31:24.350
when we hire people,

31:24.780 --> 31:26.270
we usually don't consider

31:26.290 --> 31:27.920
those with entrepreneurial experience,

31:27.920 --> 31:30.750
whether their startup succeeded or failed.

31:31.050 --> 31:33.020
Because in our experience,

31:33.160 --> 31:34.510
people who have started a business

31:34.510 --> 31:36.420
often have trouble

31:36.450 --> 31:37.590
adapting.

31:37.960 --> 31:39.020
As the saying goes,

31:39.070 --> 31:42.780
once you've had that kind of freedom,
it's hard to work for someone else.

31:42.780 --> 31:44.000
I'm afraid we have to reject you.

31:44.000 --> 31:45.930
Actually, I haven't finished yet.

31:46.720 --> 31:47.920
Can you let me finish?

31:48.070 --> 31:49.790
Alright, go ahead.

31:50.610 --> 31:52.210
I've heard what you just said

31:52.560 --> 31:53.690
countless times

31:53.720 --> 31:55.120
at other job interviews.

31:55.930 --> 31:56.530
It's true.

31:57.180 --> 31:58.400
From an employer's perspective,

31:58.400 --> 31:59.720
you wouldn't choose

31:59.720 --> 32:00.960
failed entrepreneurs like me,

32:00.960 --> 32:02.270
though before starting the business,

32:02.270 --> 32:03.770
I was a pretty good

32:03.790 --> 32:04.920
software engineer.

32:05.000 --> 32:06.200
But after starting it,

32:06.200 --> 32:08.030
from business management
to employee emotions,

32:08.030 --> 32:09.790
everything required my attention.

32:09.790 --> 32:12.240
As a result, I had less and less time

32:12.270 --> 32:13.160
to focus

32:13.270 --> 32:14.590
on my technical work.

32:15.590 --> 32:16.940
But I am also glad.

32:18.410 --> 32:19.850
That failure

32:19.880 --> 32:21.190
taught me a great deal

32:21.790 --> 32:24.830
and made me better understand
the responsibilities of this position.

32:24.830 --> 32:25.570
So,

32:27.240 --> 32:30.420
I'm asking for one chance

32:32.830 --> 32:34.200
to prove myself.

32:40.850 --> 32:41.640
I'm sorry.

32:56.720 --> 32:57.740
Sorry, baby.

32:57.960 --> 32:58.490
I'm late.

32:58.720 --> 32:59.320
It's fine.

32:59.810 --> 33:01.070
How was the interview?

33:01.590 --> 33:03.450
The interview? I'll take it slow.

33:05.130 --> 33:06.400
You've got it at 2:00 later, right?

33:06.400 --> 33:07.440
I'll drive you there.

33:07.440 --> 33:08.110
Okay.

33:21.070 --> 33:22.960
Miss Yao Jingjing,

33:23.750 --> 33:25.310
eat something first.

33:25.400 --> 33:27.180
-I'm not done yet.
-Eat something first.

33:27.180 --> 33:28.000
I'm not done yet.

33:28.000 --> 33:29.740
Let me revise it a bit.

33:30.040 --> 33:32.000
Don't be nervous.

33:32.030 --> 33:33.440
With your intelligence,

33:33.440 --> 33:34.770
you can just improvise.

33:35.720 --> 33:37.560
The problem is
that my competitors this time

33:37.560 --> 33:38.880
are all big companies.

33:39.000 --> 33:40.130
And take a look at me.

33:40.750 --> 33:43.100
I'm really stressed out now.

33:43.640 --> 33:44.700
Didn't Qian Fei say

33:44.790 --> 33:46.200
that their PR department is very satisfied

33:46.200 --> 33:47.550
with the bidding slides you sent?

33:47.550 --> 33:50.270
It's just a charity banquet.

33:50.290 --> 33:51.700
It's an easy job for you.

33:53.350 --> 33:55.080
I have great confidence in you.

33:57.150 --> 33:58.710
But this is Shanlifang,

33:58.840 --> 34:00.160
your former employer.

34:00.280 --> 34:02.350
I also offended their heiress.

34:03.030 --> 34:05.850
Just thinking about it annoys me.

34:05.880 --> 34:07.520
It's too hard, really.

34:08.120 --> 34:10.969
I think my chances are slim this time.

34:12.210 --> 34:13.590
Forget it. I'm not doing it.

34:13.590 --> 34:14.400
I'm not going.

34:19.070 --> 34:20.070
Ms. Yao Jingjing.

34:21.699 --> 34:24.050
Have you forgotten your motto?

34:25.710 --> 34:26.800
If you don't work hard,

34:26.800 --> 34:28.830
no one can give you the life you want.

34:29.000 --> 34:30.800
Even if you're falling apart inside,

34:30.800 --> 34:32.659
you must keep a smile on your face.

34:32.840 --> 34:34.170
After all, in this world,

34:34.170 --> 34:36.260
only your career won't let you down.

34:37.960 --> 34:38.850
Baby.

34:41.230 --> 34:42.880
Shanlifang is going public.

34:43.150 --> 34:44.190
If you can help them

34:44.190 --> 34:45.889
get through this PR crisis,

34:45.920 --> 34:48.139
it'll only benefit your career.

34:49.510 --> 34:51.730
Besides, the heiress of Shanlifang

34:51.750 --> 34:53.110
is in such a high position.

34:53.110 --> 34:55.840
She doesn't deal with things
like bidding, banquets,

34:55.840 --> 34:57.460
event planning, or publicity.

34:57.460 --> 34:59.530
Just do what you always do.

35:01.230 --> 35:02.290
Then,

35:02.920 --> 35:03.520
just do it?

35:04.150 --> 35:04.750
Just do it.

35:06.620 --> 35:07.430
Okay.

35:08.880 --> 35:12.230
Come on, come on.

35:14.710 --> 35:20.040
[Conference Room]

35:26.080 --> 35:27.460
Yifei, say something.

35:28.160 --> 35:29.960
The quality inspection results

35:29.980 --> 35:31.400
from the test fields we've selected

35:31.400 --> 35:32.340
haven't been very encouraging lately.

35:32.340 --> 35:34.190
If we continue at this pace,

35:34.510 --> 35:35.360
the remaining funds

35:35.360 --> 35:37.880
probably won't last
until the mid-term of the project.

35:37.880 --> 35:40.550
Should we start equity financing?

35:45.780 --> 35:46.770
It's too early.

35:47.630 --> 35:48.900
If we keep dragging this out,

35:48.900 --> 35:50.560
not finding land is one thing,

35:50.660 --> 35:52.130
but I'm more afraid
our cash flow will dry up.

35:52.130 --> 35:54.530
Then all our early efforts
will go to waste.

35:54.630 --> 36:03.550
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

35:56.550 --> 35:57.950
It's just a piece of land.

35:58.400 --> 36:00.730
Perhaps if we think about it differently,

36:00.840 --> 36:02.710
we'll find a better solution.

36:04.480 --> 36:05.410
What do you mean?

36:07.830 --> 36:14.280
[Soil Testing Data from Sampling Site
in Taishun, Zhejiang]

36:09.280 --> 36:11.610
Come, everyone, take a look at this photo.

36:15.180 --> 36:16.980
All the sites we looked at before

36:17.050 --> 36:18.480
were on plains.

36:18.800 --> 36:19.760
In this photo,

36:19.790 --> 36:20.790
this plateau

36:20.890 --> 36:24.050
gets plenty of sun,
with great vertical climate variations.

36:24.050 --> 36:26.890
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

36:24.220 --> 36:25.470
This kind of soil,

36:25.490 --> 36:27.510
developed under such unique conditions,

36:27.510 --> 36:28.880
might be more suitable

36:28.880 --> 36:30.660
as the experimental field for our project.

36:30.660 --> 36:33.140
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

36:30.920 --> 36:31.360
Right?

36:35.280 --> 36:37.130
The plateau is definitely an option.

36:37.130 --> 36:38.510
It's just that time is tight right now.

36:38.510 --> 36:39.690
If we send people over there

36:39.690 --> 36:40.760
to do on-site research now,

36:40.760 --> 36:42.190
will it delay the development
of the application

36:42.190 --> 36:43.890
in later stages of the project?

36:43.890 --> 36:44.940
Why don't we

36:45.820 --> 36:47.150
take a two-track approach?

36:47.150 --> 36:48.940
While sending people
to do on-site research,

36:48.940 --> 36:51.340
we also contact some potential investors.

36:52.710 --> 36:53.800
We have time.

36:54.030 --> 36:55.250
I will ask a friend there

36:55.250 --> 36:56.230
to send over

36:56.430 --> 36:58.280
at least 4 or 5 samples of soil

36:58.300 --> 37:01.110
from the suburban counties
in the Aba area within three days.

37:01.110 --> 37:02.110
Is that okay?

37:11.280 --> 37:14.270
Ma Li, I believe that
before the meeting today,

37:15.150 --> 37:17.440
more than one person
has already approached you

37:17.440 --> 37:18.840
about investing, right?

37:21.110 --> 37:21.590
Yes.

37:22.710 --> 37:25.210
Some even suggested
spinning off a new company,

37:25.210 --> 37:27.150
saying they'd value it

37:27.470 --> 37:28.670
at 200 million.

37:29.030 --> 37:30.340
Even with just a single slide,

37:30.340 --> 37:32.760
they were willing to give us
40 million for Series A.

37:32.760 --> 37:33.690
So you panicked.

37:34.110 --> 37:36.530
I've never seen anything like this.

37:37.130 --> 37:38.890
What they're really investing in

37:38.890 --> 37:40.280
is Fulaxida's focus on agriculture.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.360
This is a field our country

37:41.360 --> 37:43.110
urgently needs to develop.

37:43.400 --> 37:45.150
With fresh capital coming in,

37:45.630 --> 37:47.670
we'll have a much easier time

37:47.690 --> 37:49.330
expanding the business.

37:53.610 --> 37:54.940
Do you all think so, too?

38:01.070 --> 38:03.000
Then let me make my position clear.

38:04.700 --> 38:05.790
I want to ask you.

38:07.280 --> 38:08.360
What...

38:09.500 --> 38:11.190
What does Fulaxida stand for?

38:14.400 --> 38:15.930
It's being down-to-earth.

38:20.870 --> 38:21.750
So right now,

38:21.880 --> 38:23.550
before our core physical operations

38:23.550 --> 38:24.920
are fully in place,

38:24.940 --> 38:27.000
do we still have enough money on hand?

38:29.760 --> 38:31.020
Then what should we do?

38:31.100 --> 38:32.720
We have to protect the company

38:32.720 --> 38:35.920
from being hijacked
by capital in its early growth stage.

38:37.850 --> 38:39.320
I firmly disagree with moving forward

38:39.320 --> 38:40.920
with another funding round.

38:45.880 --> 38:47.190
I know you're unhappy.

38:47.550 --> 38:49.280
I'm sorry, but I have no choice.

38:49.420 --> 38:50.800
At this moment, I must use

38:50.800 --> 38:51.710
my veto power.

38:51.740 --> 38:52.770
Then you will miss

38:52.790 --> 38:54.250
an exponential growth opportunity!

38:54.250 --> 38:55.950
That's what you think.

38:55.970 --> 38:57.900
That's how venture capital works.

38:59.230 --> 39:00.050
I'm telling you,

39:00.050 --> 39:02.860
every VC calculates the odds.

39:03.010 --> 39:04.280
Do you really think these people

39:04.280 --> 39:05.670
would be stupid enough to spend so much

39:05.670 --> 39:06.550
to invest in such an

39:06.550 --> 39:08.750
inexperienced startup team like ours?

39:11.280 --> 39:13.190
Other than assuming Qiansheng Group

39:13.190 --> 39:14.920
is backing us up,

39:16.110 --> 39:17.440
there is only one possibility.

39:17.440 --> 39:18.500
What possibility?

39:18.660 --> 39:20.770
They have ulterior motives, bro.

39:20.790 --> 39:21.780
I don't understand.

39:21.780 --> 39:23.170
Of course you don't.

39:23.420 --> 39:25.200
As an investor, I know it too well

39:25.200 --> 39:27.800
that capital has no feelings.
It's like water.

39:31.980 --> 39:33.950
It can float a boat, or sink it.

39:34.610 --> 39:36.140
I reject the financing.

39:36.710 --> 39:38.410
It's not to protect my shares

39:38.440 --> 39:39.570
from being diluted.

39:43.920 --> 39:46.450
I'm protecting
Fulaxida's original vision.

39:52.280 --> 39:54.440
Before we are strong enough,

39:55.390 --> 39:57.280
financial magnates will force us

39:57.280 --> 39:59.530
to become a quick money-making machine.

39:59.530 --> 40:00.630
They will force us to give up

40:00.630 --> 40:04.230
our original vision that we stated
at the Venture Capital Forum!

40:05.590 --> 40:06.840
Is this what you want?

40:06.860 --> 40:08.260
Is this what you all want?

40:12.880 --> 40:13.880
I think deep down,

40:13.880 --> 40:15.480
you already have the answer.

40:19.510 --> 40:20.640
Meeting adjourned.

40:22.190 --> 40:23.320
Meeting adjourned.

40:27.100 --> 40:30.790
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

40:28.430 --> 40:29.430
Good for you.

40:29.760 --> 40:31.860
That's the heir
to Qiansheng Manufacturing for you.

40:31.860 --> 40:34.320
Others are eagerly waiting for investment,

40:34.710 --> 40:36.070
while you're pushing it away.

40:36.070 --> 40:37.190
Stop right there.

40:38.110 --> 40:39.230
Up until today,

40:39.250 --> 40:40.090
let me ask you,

40:40.630 --> 40:43.480
have I used a single cent
from Qiansheng Manufacturing?

40:41.490 --> 40:43.330
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

40:46.470 --> 40:50.170
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

40:49.020 --> 40:50.080
Oh, now you're mad?

40:52.870 --> 40:54.270
Feeling wronged?

40:56.710 --> 40:57.960
Trust me.

40:58.400 --> 41:00.900
When the time is right,
I won't have to do a thing.

41:00.900 --> 41:05.890
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

41:01.030 --> 41:02.840
Qiansheng Manufacturing
will come to us on its own.

41:02.840 --> 41:03.840
Just wait and see.

41:04.420 --> 41:06.150
It's not that I don't trust you.

41:06.510 --> 41:08.760
I'm just afraid we'll miss the boat.

41:08.840 --> 41:13.740
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

41:09.010 --> 41:11.540
It's rare for you to be
so obsessed with money.

41:11.900 --> 41:13.510
I'm actually a bit curious
about which investors

41:13.510 --> 41:14.710
are approaching you.

41:16.130 --> 41:17.460
Anyway, I have to say...

41:19.920 --> 41:21.050
There's quite a lot.

41:21.670 --> 41:22.480
The one from Shenzhen—

41:22.480 --> 41:23.150
Ma Li.

41:26.070 --> 41:26.760
You should

41:26.780 --> 41:28.950
focus on what you're good at.

41:29.810 --> 41:31.520
Leave the investor games to me.

41:31.520 --> 41:33.180
I will clear them away for you.

41:38.810 --> 41:43.550
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

41:43.660 --> 41:45.660
Have you sorted out the new R&D team?

41:47.560 --> 41:49.890
It's hard, especially for core members.

41:50.310 --> 41:51.560
You don't even need to look at these.

41:51.560 --> 41:52.560
They're useless.

41:54.530 --> 41:56.580
It's only been a few days
since we last met.

41:56.580 --> 41:58.040
Where's that fired-up Mr. Ma

41:58.040 --> 41:59.840
from the Venture Capital Forum?

42:00.770 --> 42:07.590
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

42:00.880 --> 42:02.550
He's gone. He's changed.

42:05.070 --> 42:07.440
I have a lot of confidence in Fulaxida.

42:07.960 --> 42:09.220
I have confidence too.

42:09.370 --> 42:11.370
I believe that in this era,

42:11.930 --> 42:13.930
outsiders can disrupt the industry

42:14.070 --> 42:15.730
and achieve a paradigm shift.

42:17.950 --> 42:18.880
What did you say?

42:20.000 --> 42:20.930
Paradigm shift.

42:21.760 --> 42:22.820
The previous line.

42:25.200 --> 42:27.260
Outsiders can disrupt the industry.

42:30.670 --> 42:31.150
Right.

42:34.610 --> 42:37.110
It suddenly occurred to me

42:37.670 --> 42:40.730
that Fulaxida might
need a different hiring strategy.

42:41.920 --> 42:42.850
What do you mean?

42:43.400 --> 42:44.330
Find teammates?

42:45.510 --> 42:46.970
I just thought of someone.

42:48.610 --> 42:49.610
Find teammates?

42:52.210 --> 42:53.740
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.030 --> 42:54.840
What?

42:55.290 --> 42:56.090
Do you want it?

42:56.410 --> 42:57.490
[Flight Ticket: Shanghai to Shanxi]

42:57.810 --> 42:59.150
My flight ticket home?

42:59.590 --> 43:01.930
I've decided to look
at you in a new light.

43:02.840 --> 43:03.380
Wait,

43:03.410 --> 43:05.010
how did you look at me before?

43:08.570 --> 43:09.770
Why are you here?

43:10.140 --> 43:10.770
Ms. Liao,

43:11.210 --> 43:12.450
about the apology

43:12.710 --> 43:13.690
I suggested last time...

43:13.690 --> 43:15.090
I drafted a speech.

43:15.370 --> 43:17.430
I hope you can consider it carefully.

43:17.430 --> 43:19.810
The media is here tonight.
I won't put you on the spot.

43:19.810 --> 43:20.910
Anyway,

43:21.320 --> 43:23.540
please take a look
before you make a decision.
